From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Swanson <rswanson05@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:05:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat: place the needs-input section right under the spaces
 list

When the spaces list leaves room, the needs-input section sits directly
under it and moves as spaces and agents come and go. It only drops to
the bottom, with the spaces list scrolling, when there is not enough
room.

